@startuml
skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor "Field Agent (Android)" as Agent
actor "Admin/User (Browser)" as Admin

node "Docker Compose Environment" {
  component "Nginx Proxy\n(SSL Termination)" as Nginx
  component "Backend API\n(Node/Express)" as Backend
  component "Web Portal\n(Vite/React)" as Web
  database "MySQL DB" as DB
  folder "Storage Volume\n(Uploaded Photos)" as Storage
  component "Docker Daemon\n(Socket)" as DockerSock
}

Agent --> Backend : HTTP/HTTPS (JWT)
Agent --> Web : (optional) Web view
Web --> Backend : HTTP/HTTPS (JWT)
Backend --> DB : SQL Queries
Backend --> Storage : Store/Retrieve photos
Backend --> DockerSock : Docker control API
Nginx --> Backend : Reverse Proxy
Nginx --> Web : Serve static assets
Admin --> Nginx : HTTPS requests

@enduml
